OL,3,GNEWSAVillage 200-home plan considered
OL,4,Aafter appeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for up to 200 homes in a village
OL,7,Fare being considered after a council
OL,8,Flost an appeal.
OL,10,FAvant Homes submitted plans for the
OL,11,Fdevelopment near Low Lane and Thornaby
OL,12,FRoad in Thornaby, on 24 acres (9.7
OL,13,Fhectares) of fields but said it would
OL,14,Fnot include a primary school,
OL,15,Fmulti-cultural centre or extension to
OL,16,FMaltby Cricket Club.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
