OL,3,GNEWSAVillage 200-home plan considered
OL,4,Aafter appeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FStockton Council previously rejected an
OL,7,Foutline plan for the homes with a
OL,8,Fneighbourhood centre and community
OL,9,Fcentre dating back to 2018, however a
OL,10,Fplanning inspector allowed an appeal
OL,11,Fagainst the decision in April last
OL,12,Fyear.
OL,14,FThe development would include one to
OL,15,Ffour-bedroom bungalows, semi-detached
OL,16,Fand detached houses accessed via a
OL,17,Fjunction from Low Lane.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
